# Only the GENERATED data artifacts under storage/ — not storage/*.py.
# Real bug found running `docker compose build`: an earlier version of
# this file excluded the whole storage/ directory, which also excluded
# storage/vector_store.py and storage/chunk_store.py (real source code the
# Dockerfile's pre-warm layer explicitly COPYs) — the build failed with
# "storage/vector_store.py: not found". Scoped to the actual data
# subpaths below, matching storage/.gitignore's equivalent entries.
storage/chroma_db/
storage/chunk_store.db
storage/ingestion_manifest.db
storage/pubmed_synced.db
storage/images/
uploads/
sample_data/
test_data/
